00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,373
A report on SAP-shaped tables. Is the total right?

2
00:00:04,473 --> 00:00:07,821
The semantic model keeps the order amount on the order header.

3
00:00:07,921 --> 00:00:12,024
Net order value: EUR 750, counted once per order.

4
00:00:12,124 --> 00:00:15,843
Summed over the order lines, it would be 1 950.

5
00:00:15,943 --> 00:00:21,206
After the build, Krusgraph reads the model back and counts the figures again from the rows.

6
00:00:21,556 --> 00:00:25,343
Try it in your browser: krusgraph.com/check
